    "UIName": "Musketeer (UA)",
    "Id": "vehicledef_MUSKETEER_ARMOR",
    "Name": "Musketeer (UA)",
    "Details": "The Musketeer hover tank is a combat vehicle designed to deliver concentrated firepower quickly and cheaply. The hovertank is as difficult to kill as a hover vehicle can be, with seven tons of ferro-fibrous armor protecting it, and CASE protecting its four-person crew from internal explosions. An internal combustion engine is inexpensive and can still maintain speeds up to 119 km/h. This variant developed in 3068 replaces the autocannon with a smaller RAC/2. The loss of firepower nonetheless enabled engineers to add additional armor, making the Musketeer even more difficult to bring down.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar or Martian biomes due to using an ICE.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 7/11 hexes / 210/330 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       220     25\n<b>Left</b>         170     25\n<b>Right</b>       170     25\n<b>Rear</b>        140     25\n<b>Turret</b>      185     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      885    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - Ballistics</color>",
    "Icon": "Regulator"
  },
